# Some static hosts default unknown/binary extensions to
# application/octet-stream, which breaks WebAssembly.instantiateStreaming
# (Drift's sqlite3 wasm build needs the real MIME type). And since this
# file and drift_worker.js are copied verbatim (no content hash in the
# filename — see README "Web setup"), a long default cache lifetime would
# let a returning visitor keep an old worker after a drift/sqlite3 bump;
# capped short instead of Cloudflare Pages' default long edge cache.
/sqlite3.wasm
  Content-Type: application/wasm
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=3600

/drift_worker.js
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=3600
